 "ritsumeikan_koko_eigo_38": { caption: "答え　How many times have you been to Kyoto?", slides: [{"note": "回数をたずねる、現在完了（経験）の疑問文を英語にする問題。", "add": [{"t": "label", "x": 12, "y": 19, "text": "① 状況・問い", "size": 12, "color": "#0284C7", "anchor": "start", "bold": true}, {"t": "box", "x": 20, "y": 28, "w": 280, "h": 50, "text": "あなたは京都に何回\n行ったことがありますか。", "color": "#6E645C", "fill": "#F1EFEA", "size": 12}, {"t": "arrow", "x1": 160, "y1": 80, "x2": 160, "y2": 96, "color": "#0284C7"}, {"t": "box", "x": 20, "y": 98, "w": 280, "h": 64, "text": "英語に直そう", "color": "#0284C7", "fill": "#E0F2FE", "size": 12}]}, {"note": "手がかりを探す。「〜したことがある」は現在完了（経験）。回数をたずねる言い方は？", "add": [{"t": "label", "x": 12, "y": 19, "text": "② 手がかり", "size": 12, "color": "#16A34A", "anchor": "start", "bold": true}, {"t": "box", "x": 20, "y": 28, "w": 280, "h": 50, "text": "あなたは京都に何回\n行ったことがありますか。", "color": "#6E645C", "fill": "#F1EFEA", "size": 12}, {"t": "arrow", "x1": 160, "y1": 80, "x2": 160, "y2": 96, "color": "#16A34A"}, {"t": "box", "x": 20, "y": 98, "w": 280, "h": 64, "text": "「〜したことがある」\n＝ 現在完了（経験）", "color": "#16A34A", "fill": "#DCFCE7", "size": 12}]}, {"note": "「〜に行ったことがある」は have been to ～ で表す。回数をたずねるときは How many times を文頭に置き、そのあとに現在完了の疑問文 have you been to ～ の語順を続ける。have gone to は「行ってしまって今ここにいない」という意味なので経験には使えない。", "add": [{"t": "label", "x": 12, "y": 19, "text": "③ 理由", "size": 12, "color": "#9333EA", "anchor": "start", "bold": true}, {"t": "box", "x": 20, "y": 28, "w": 280, "h": 50, "text": "あなたは京都に何回\n行ったことがありますか。", "color": "#6E645C", "fill": "#F1EFEA", "size": 12}, {"t": "arrow", "x1": 160, "y1": 80, "x2": 160, "y2": 96, "color": "#9333EA"}, {"t": "box", "x": 20, "y": 98, "w": 280, "h": 64, "text": "回数は How many times\n＋ 現在完了の疑問文", "color": "#9333EA", "fill": "#F3E8FF", "size": 12}]}, {"note": "回数をたずねる語句を文頭に。How many times（何回）。", "add": [{"t": "label", "x": 12, "y": 19, "text": "④ 手順1", "size": 12, "color": "#B5622E", "anchor": "start", "bold": true}, {"t": "box", "x": 20, "y": 28, "w": 280, "h": 50, "text": "あなたは京都に何回\n行ったことがありますか。", "color": "#6E645C", "fill": "#F1EFEA", "size": 12}, {"t": "arrow", "x1": 160, "y1": 80, "x2": 160, "y2": 96, "color": "#B5622E"}, {"t": "box", "x": 20, "y": 98, "w": 280, "h": 64, "text": "have you been to Kyoto\n（Have you been to ...?）", "color": "#B5622E", "fill": "#FFF8EC", "size": 12}]}, {"note": "現在完了の疑問文を続ける。have you been to Kyoto（あなたは京都に行ったことがありますか）。", "add": [{"t": "label", "x": 12, "y": 19, "text": "⑤ 手順2", "size": 12, "color": "#E11D48", "anchor": "start", "bold": true}, {"t": "box", "x": 20, "y": 28, "w": 280, "h": 50, "text": "あなたは京都に何回\n行ったことがありますか。", "color": "#6E645C", "fill": "#F1EFEA", "size": 12}, {"t": "arrow", "x1": 160, "y1": 80, "x2": 160, "y2": 96, "color": "#E11D48"}, {"t": "box", "x": 20, "y": 98, "w": 280, "h": 64, "text": "How many times と\nつなぐ", "color": "#E11D48", "fill": "#FFE4E6", "size": 12}]}, {"note": "答え：How many times have you been to Kyoto?", "add": [{"t": "label", "x": 12, "y": 19, "text": "⑥ 答え", "size": 12, "color": "#16A34A", "anchor": "start", "bold": true}, {"t": "box", "x": 20, "y": 28, "w": 280, "h": 50, "text": "あなたは京都に何回\n行ったことがありますか。", "color": "#6E645C", "fill": "#F1EFEA", "size": 12}, {"t": "arrow", "x1": 160, "y1": 80, "x2": 160, "y2": 96, "color": "#16A34A"}, {"t": "box", "x": 20, "y": 98, "w": 280, "h": 70, "text": "答え　How many times have you\nbeen to Kyoto?", "color": "#16A34A", "fill": "#DCFCE7", "size": 13}]}, {"note": "日本語に戻す。「あなたは京都に何回行ったことがありますか」。have の位置は you の前で、been の形になっている。", "add": [{"t": "label", "x": 12, "y": 19, "text": "⑦ 確かめ", "size": 12, "color": "#0284C7", "anchor": "start", "bold": true}, {"t": "box", "x": 20, "y": 28, "w": 280, "h": 50, "text": "あなたは京都に何回\n行ったことがありますか。", "color": "#6E645C", "fill": "#F1EFEA", "size": 12}, {"t": "arrow", "x1": 160, "y1": 80, "x2": 160, "y2": 96, "color": "#0284C7"}, {"t": "box", "x": 20, "y": 98, "w": 280, "h": 64, "text": "How many times have you\nbeen to Kyoto?", "color": "#0284C7", "fill": "#E0F2FE", "size": 12}]}] }
